	"data": "Concept: The Core System\n\nWhat It Is\n\nA recurring architectural vision spanning 2021–present. The Core System is a dynamic module-loading runtime — its only job is to load, register, and connect apps/plugins/modules. Everything else is a module. No feature is baked in; everything can be added or removed at runtime.\n\nIt's not a single app. It's the engine underneath apps. ThoughtBubbles, for example, is the flagship module of the Core System — not the Core System itself.\n\nHistory &…",
